  "interpretation": "The tape's +200 drift is carried roughly equally by follow-through fills (+2.52 ticks) and LO repricing (+2.81); cancels push AGAINST the drift (-0.68). The calibrated sim's fills actually OVERSHOOT (+4.85) \u2014 the gap is the LO channel: post-fill limit arrivals on the tape reprice the mid WITH the drift while the sim's hit-side refill drags it back (-2.53, a 5.34-tick shortfall). The mechanism gap is which SIDE of the book the post-fill placements land on, not the fill cadence.",
